واردسازی رابط گرافیکی.رابط کاربری

تابع ریشه:
    چاپ رابط کاربری.گزارش سند(`<!doctype html><html><head><style>body{margin:0;font-size:0;line-height:0}.s{display:inline-block;height:10px;background:#888}div.p{width:300px;background:#eee}.it{display:inline-table;border-spacing:2px;border:1px solid #000}.it td{padding:0;vertical-align:baseline}.ig{display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:20px 30px;gap:2px;border:1px solid #000}#g1,#g3{height:12px}</style></head><body><div class="p" id="p1"><span class="s" id="a" style="width:20px"></span><table class="it" id="t"><tr id="r1"><td id="c1"><span class="s" style="width:15px"></span></td><td id="c2"><span class="s" style="width:25px;height:20px"></span></td></tr><tr><td id="c3"><span class="s" style="width:10px"></span></td></tr></table><span class="s" id="b" style="width:30px"></span><div class="ig" id="g"><div id="g1"></div><div id="g2" style="height:20px"></div><div id="g3"></div></div><span class="s" id="c" style="width:12px"></span></div></body></html>`، 640، 480)
    چاپ رابط کاربری.گزارش سند(`<!doctype html><html><head><style>body{margin:0;font-size:0;line-height:0}.s{display:inline-block;height:10px;width:10px;background:#888}div.p{width:200px;background:#eee;margin-bottom:4px}.it{display:inline-table;border-spacing:0;border:2px solid #000}.it td{padding:1px;vertical-align:baseline}.ig{display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:20px;border:1px solid #000;padding:3px}.m{vertical-align:middle}.tp{vertical-align:top}.w{width:150px}</style></head><body><div class="p" id="p1"><span class="s" id="a"></span><table class="it" id="t"><caption id="cap"><span class="s"></span></caption><tr><td id="c1"><span class="s" style="height:20px"></span></td></tr></table><span class="s" id="b"></span></div><div class="p" id="p2"><span class="s" id="a2"></span><div class="ig" id="g0"></div><div class="ig m" id="g1"><div id="x1" style="height:14px"></div></div><table class="it" id="t2"><tr><td><span class="s"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="s"></span></td></tr></table><span class="s" id="b2"></span></div><div class="p" id="p3"><span class="s" id="a3" style="width:100px"></span><table class="it" id="t3"><tr><td><span class="s" style="width:60px"></span></td><td><span class="s" style="width:60px"></span></td></tr></table><div class="ig" id="g3" style="grid-template-columns:30px 30px"><div></div><div style="height:5px"></div></div></div><div class="p" id="p4"><span class="s" id="a4"></span><div style="display:inline-flex;border:1px solid #000;align-items:center" id="f4"><span class="s" style="height:30px"></span><span class="s"></span></div><span class="s"></span></div></body></html>`، 640، 480)
